  <item>
    <title>15. 从什么时候开始，我们不再谈论梦想了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e536c18bf86095c51b1307</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e536c18bf86095c51b1307</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 00后也开始年龄焦虑了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 20多岁，一个尴尬的年纪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> “You are on your own, kid”是自由，更是恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">06:07</a> 规则的悖论：一边限制你，一边保护你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 成长的代价是一步步变得收敛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> “班味儿”是从哪一刻开始染上的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> “年少成名”的叙事，让我们开始怀疑自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 从什么时候开始，我们不再谈论梦想了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 谈梦想，我“配”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> 年龄越大，梦想越小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 我们为何如此慕强，甚至崇拜天生的优越？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 努力，我做错了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> “松弛感”是一种陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 主包坦白了，主包不敢录播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 勇气，是在承认平庸后，依然敢于直面内心的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span>假期快乐～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6373065714fd3e269bdd3340/lkJwe4NMrPB7dyk847OSD4iXEfvn.m4a" length="35360830" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBA6CHBhyUfB3H60FYPRY3Rbubn.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>15</itunes:episode>
