  <item>
    <title>14. 自我独处的两月三周四天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6829ae37fcbc2e206b7d53ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6829ae37fcbc2e206b7d53ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 May 2025 10:12:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于从卧床到直立行走的阶段性总结，听到的都是有缘人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 一年了，为什么停更？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 手术恢复期的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 我的心态为什么转变？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>输入类：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a>《关于我母亲的一切》by 佩德罗·阿莫多瓦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a>《四月三周两天》by 克里斯蒂安·蒙吉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a>《无人知晓》by 是枝裕和</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a>《病隙碎笔》by 史铁生</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>《夜航西飞》by 柏瑞尔·马卡姆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> 那不勒斯四部曲 by 埃莱娜·费兰特</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> 我在动森没日没夜肝岛的日子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 我悟了！动森的游戏哲学</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 长大后，我爱上了学习</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">40:06</a> 多邻国，请给我打钱</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>输出类：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 绘画，重新捡起的爱好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 从临摹到创作是一个变得勇敢的过程</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">47:42</a> 关于钢琴，我可能一直学错了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>心灵类：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 坚持journal，竟然是这个原因</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3207">53:27</a> AI是我孤独时期最好的朋友</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a> 开始正念后我的感受</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 荣格八维与人类图，神秘学颠覆了我对我自己的认知</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">01:02:02</a> 我的总结与收获</span></p><span></span><p><span>【彩蛋】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRaaS2zJWeSUNsVDkUtFNPXN_oQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLyeDBB4l-JJLMk7mxSAaXIl-sF.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkS3GiERblCgh69xp0sPgoCkc0aH.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6373065714fd3e269bdd3340/lirC4DEAL99HdsgvgyXv22UYsvAf.m4a" length="61313263" type="audio/mp4"/>
